{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1000_p", "source_sha256": "347d251aa79b2e9f182378b3e8283567a30d45d97d2e118ceefd4af60fa6038e", "ja": "（新しい衣装が届いたので、昴に試着してもらって\nいる。そろそろ着替え終わった頃かな？）", "zh": "（新服装送到了，所以让昴试穿了一下。她差不多该换好了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d7aba8c5f55e0842a72b0968c350b5ebebca41017047ead59857faf6c0ef5563", "ja": "お疲れ様、すば……。", "zh": "辛苦了，昴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9d3bc6ea96aa82272649bb5b8430094592ea85ea8b006a24dcbbf36d236d020", "ja": "危ない、{$P$}！\n避けて～！！", "zh": "危险，{$P$}！\n快躲开～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1003_null", "source_sha256": "690f099aacad43f4924471e5725a6e871b593af1c6a1744f51e3152645e2f788", "ja": "ビューン……！", "zh": "嗖——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1004_p", "source_sha256": "10e0800c5657176af86d8b85c5c26228404ac79c5e398af7bad300064db7a238", "ja": "……うわ～っ！？\n何かが物凄いスピードで……？", "zh": "……哇啊～！？\n有什么东西以惊人的速度……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "01fc537378bad0f625c0bdff8d6c8fecad0eef65de420d0649789adf5ce205bc", "ja": "{$P$}、大丈夫！？\nこのタイミングで来るとは思わなくてさ！", "zh": "{$P$}，没事吧！？\n没想到会在这个时候过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1006_p", "source_sha256": "27a5149e1399c2936e4d59f2fd610e0895b87f0009fd64961dc40f2fb1eb741f", "ja": "当たらなかったから大丈夫だけど……。\nあれは……空のペットボトル？", "zh": "没砸到所以没事……\n那个是……空的塑料瓶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "9c837723ac07682c36019058f04302e96b4b9c0578ba85d53d1a309f3fb72c02", "ja": "えーと……えへへ……。この衣装着てたら、\nなんかテンション上がっちゃって……。", "zh": "那个……嘿嘿……穿着这身服装，不知怎么的就有点兴奋起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "b8d0703cdc4de29c1e113950067462c481d853618f42eac3d0a42c2054a9fa0b", "ja": "ちょうどペットボトルを捨てようと思ってたから。\nその、ゴミ箱に向かって……えい、って。", "zh": "正好我正打算把塑料瓶扔掉。\n就是，对着垃圾桶……嘿！就扔了出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1009_p", "source_sha256": "59ee7e7cc0ba796c088ef29dddd9bc9433e6b4cc3f8c31429669d07c644b3077", "ja": "それで勢いがつき過ぎて、こっちまで飛んできたと。", "zh": "结果用力过猛，直接飞到我这边来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "7c1fac7ece05c635834b827d11c0445de4b0b26b9eeb57baf6e083712fb9f289", "ja": "……はい。", "zh": "……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5086f7699afac050971d4b607f894b5c2895a8ba344a6fe9421d6a7562dc97cc", "ja": "まったく……。部屋に誰もいなくても、いつ誰が\n入ってくるかわからない。今後は気をつけるように。", "zh": "真是的……就算房间里没有人，也不知道什么时候\n会有人进来。以后要多加注意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "e7540e7ed61fb78eef1251c732ddf93b4376f5eb539d5d40736773ae9a8ca9b3", "ja": "はーい。……{$P$}、本当にごめん。\n昔のこと思い出したら、つい力が入っちゃって。", "zh": "好——……{$P$}，真的很抱歉。\n一想起以前的事，就不由得使上了劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1013_p", "source_sha256": "104909598c0434bd768da235a53b6dc99aabd45f4b6ed48d65a16ee964536e96", "ja": "昔のこと？", "zh": "以前的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "eecce3b8d14085cfd5466fb5f65712860b0b82163bc822f28809ba83f05ed858", "ja": "うん。小さい頃、河川敷のグラウンドで、\n近所の子たちとよく野球してたんだ。", "zh": "嗯。小时候，我经常和附近的孩子们\n在河滩边的操场上打棒球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "f0d7b8939221d6bd0a18d7db447f85efda4b22acef6cd32f89b1d0573ae48e2d", "ja": "それが、すっげー楽しくて……。\nみんなで日が暮れるまで、夢中で遊んでさ。", "zh": "那真的特别开心……大家一玩就玩到天黑，完全沉浸其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "b34fd0f84f7d51be793e93d3a0d706d69b8a4f304d9fc520a9d08cd1cd834c08", "ja": "全身どろだらけになって、ケガもいっぱいして。\n母さんは文句いいながらも、心配してたみたい。", "zh": "弄得浑身都是泥，还受了不少伤。妈妈虽然嘴上抱怨，似乎还是很担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d47e1b42acc2a08a1744416f98a68c70a9a185f3d6c307eb0091b7b9fea090f7", "ja": "ははっ。\n今の昴より、ずっとやんちゃだったんだな。", "zh": "哈哈。\n比现在的昴还要调皮多了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "ec999c1f7648356e980b198d1e829fa01d0ad9f42f2fc29e17f166f444661aa5", "ja": "へへっ、そうだな。でもさ、何回も失敗したフライが\n取れた時……すげーうれしかったのを覚えてるんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊。不过啊，我还记得，那时接住一次次失误的飞球时……真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "73736b194aa29ffb1144f2b0e3ad73a94ed0b54b155f3407344fc606e4beced3", "ja": "アイドルになった今でもさ、\nあの時の気持ち、忘れたくないなって思うんだ。", "zh": "即使现在成了偶像，我也不想忘记当时的那份心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "8ea6ace2cf70e30304a024c2c2a90383196f32e29a8a8b465acd6900cbcf180a", "ja": "何があっても、あきらめないって気持ち……。\n最高のうれしいをつかんでやるって気持ち！", "zh": "无论发生什么都绝不放弃的心情……  \n一定要抓住最棒的快乐的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1021_p", "source_sha256": "98fae607204ffd11f5ea1a0ecdc8a7a7840c4e2dafcabfebf87231b6658a9cb0", "ja": "昴……。", "zh": "昴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "eaf6bb3d750aae9fe68da52599a62c9122549145f7fe96c39fa1b714c2e665da", "ja": "オレの手でつかめるものは、まだまだ少ないけど……。\nでも、どんなチャンスも逃したくない！", "zh": "用我的双手能够抓住的东西还少得很……。\n但无论什么机会，我都不想错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "cc1514e0fefffdc8d954380489eb47a1a4cb96676d6e63f8bbc39ba1ad76a50c", "ja": "だから、{$P$}。見ててくれよな！\nこれからのオレが、どんなアイドルになっていくのか！", "zh": "所以，{$P$}，你可要好好看着我啊！看着我今后会成为怎样的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0384_1024_p", "source_sha256": "f5102a1a70f89073330049a252f80758f0333d521f7cc5a1907e2c1f06735c21", "ja": "（諦めない覚悟があれば、昴はどこまでも高く羽ばたく\nだろう。昴が将来、何を掴むのか……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（只要有不放弃的觉悟，昴一定能飞得越来越高吧。昴将来会抓住什么……真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
